      "message": "The only thing is that these enums are all auto-generated by the auto-generated CertificateTransparencyStatsLog class from the proto. I don\u0027t love how unwieldy the lines are, but duplicating the enum values just to make the lines shorter (and potentially resulting in mistakes) doesn\u0027t feel fully justified imo?\n\nOne thing we could do is move this helper method into CertificateTransparencyLoggerImpl if that helps with readability in CTDownloader. The only thing is we pass in the direct enum values for some failure cases (HTTP_ERROR, SIGNATURE_VERIFICATION, VERSION_ALREADY_EXISTS) so the logic would then be split across CTDownloader and CTLogger. WDYT?",
